    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-03T00:34:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A small tray by the front door can corral keys, post and loose change; give each item a fixed place and the daily search becomes simpler.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#ffbdb78ee99d01bf543fb01020b159060c810f32e82e0e9610a32d01e336b576</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-03T00:34:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">The first public libraries made knowledge available beyond private collections: people pooling books created a lasting way for curiosity to travel across generations.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#f793edc89158e5c586c499d9523fc2f028bc058630930a74691e89a2bf3bd839</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-03T00:34:49Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Spend three minutes renaming one vaguely titled computer file with its date and purpose, then move it into a clearly named folder.</div>
    </content>
